IV. CONCLUSIONS
The generic TEB approach for local trajectory planning
and control offers substantial advantages for navigation of
car-like robots namely computationally efficiency, unsuper
vised emergence of motion reversals and minimal require
ments on the global planner. TEB reliably and efficiently
generates feasible minimum-time trajectories that constitute
not necessarily a global but in any case local optimum.
